# Daily retention sweep — delete student accounts inactive
# longer than the retention period (05:00 local time, see
# django/fisingas/users/management/commands/delete_old_students.py).
# 05:00, not 03:00: the container runs on local time, and 03:00
# is exactly the hour DST skips in spring and repeats in autumn
0 5 * * * docker exec fisingas-django python manage.py delete_old_students
